OL,3,GNEWSATheatre security centre stage
OL,4,Aafter break-ins
OL,5,
OL,6,FA theatre is bidding for council
OL,7,Ffunding to bolster its security after
OL,8,Fbeing hit by break-ins, thefts and
OL,9,Fantisocial behaviour.
OL,11,FA report due before Hull City Council's
OL,12,Fcrime prevention grants sub-committee
OL,13,Frevealed that Hull Truck Theatre was
OL,14,Ftargeted in three separate break-in and
OL,15,Frobbery attempts between October 2025
OL,16,Fand March 2026.
OL,18,FIn two cases, offenders succeeded in
OL,19,Fgaining access while audiences were
OL,20,Fwatching performances and staff were at
OL,21,Fwork, stealing both professional
OL,22,Fequipment and personal belongings.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
